   international joint PAGES (Past Global Changes)/CLIVAR (Climate
   Variability and Predictability) intersection working group in concert
   with the PAGES office in Bern, Switzerland. The workshop, which was
   funded by EPRI (Electric Power Research Institute), PAGES, the Swiss
   NCCR-Climate Programme and CLIVAR, represented the continued efforts of
   the international PAGES/CLIVAR intersection to identify the key priority
   areas for future international collaborative research to advance
