   Havlin, Shlomo, Bar Ilan Univ, Minerva Ctr, Ramat Gan, Israel.
   Havlin, Shlomo, Bar Ilan Univ, Dept Phys, Ramat Gan, Israel.
   Kantelhardt, Jan W., Zentrum Computat Nanosci, Halle, Germany.},
