   from limited observational evidence, and to the ongoing task of drawing
   detailed and reliable information on the state, and change, of climate
   that is needed, for example, for short-term and seasonal forecasting. We
   conclude with recommendations of how to improve the practice of
   statistical analysis in the climate sciences by drawing more efficiently
   on relevant developments in statistical mathematics. Copyright (C) 2004
